# First-order logic

Planned API for first-order languages, terms, formulas, syntax and semantics,
models and theories, proof systems, and completeness.  The source has
dedicated material for natural deduction, sequents, tableaux, and axiomatic
deduction; these will remain explicit interfaces rather than being silently
identified with one another.

The first semantic API is implemented in `FormalOLP.FirstOrderLogic.SemanticNotions`.
